'''Firewatch''' (火の用心, ''Hi no Yōjin'', '''Caution with Fire''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Weaken" Effect UP (Sm): Weaken duration increases by 10%.

